specified in the asset allocation table of the Scheme, subject to permissible limits laid under SEBI (MF)
Regulations or any other applicable laws and guidelines.
• Equity and equity related instruments:
Investments in below securities will be as per the investment strategy and as per the limits specified in the
asset allocation table of Scheme, subject to permissible limits laid under SEBI (MF) Regulations.
